  <Sequence DisplayName="Step5 최종 JSON 조립 테스트"><Sequence.Variables><Variable x:TypeArguments="x:String" Default="[System.IO.Path.Combine(System.Environment.CurrentDirectory, &quot;test_data&quot;)]" Name="testDir" /><Variable x:TypeArguments="x:String" Default="[System.IO.Path.Combine(System.Environment.CurrentDirectory, &quot;test_data_out&quot;)]" Name="outDir" /><Variable x:TypeArguments="scg:List(x:String)" Default="[New System.Collections.Generic.List(Of String) From {&quot;ok_S00007727&quot;, &quot;ok_S00007728&quot;, &quot;ok_S00007729&quot;, &quot;ok_S00007730&quot;, &quot;ok_S00007731&quot;, &quot;conf_boundary_0_6&quot;, &quot;conf_below_0_59&quot;, &quot;retry_then_ok&quot;, &quot;analysis_failed&quot;, &quot;stt_failed&quot;, &quot;input_failed&quot;}]" Name="scenarios" /></Sequence.Variables><ui:ForEach x:TypeArguments="x:String" CurrentIndex="{x:Null}" DisplayName="시나리오별 반복" Values="[scenarios]"><ui:ForEach.Body><ActivityAction x:TypeArguments="x:String"><ActivityAction.Argument><DelegateInArgument x:TypeArguments="x:String" Name="scName" /></ActivityAction.Argument><Sequence DisplayName="시나리오 처리"><Sequence.Variables><Variable x:TypeArguments="x:String" Name="maskedJson" /><Variable x:TypeArguments="x:String" Name="analysisJson" /><Variable x:TypeArguments="x:String" Name="metaJson" /><Variable x:TypeArguments="x:String" Name="fileName" /><Variable x:TypeArguments="x:Int32" Default="[0]" Name="seq" /><Variable x:TypeArguments="x:String" Name="nowIso" /><Variable x:TypeArguments="x:String" Name="promptVersion" /><Variable x:TypeArguments="x:String" Name="sttEngine" /><Variable x:TypeArguments="x:String" Name="genaiModel" /><Variable x:TypeArguments="x:String" Name="sttStage" /><Variable x:TypeArguments="x:String" Name="sttError" /><Variable x:TypeArguments="x:String" Name="docJson" /><Variable x:TypeArguments="x:String" Name="assembleError" /></Sequence.Variables><ui:ReadTextFile File="{x:Null}" Content="[maskedJson]" DisplayName="마스킹 결과 읽기" Encoding="utf-8" FileName="[System.IO.Path.Combine(testDir, &quot;step5&quot;, scName, &quot;masked.json&quot;)]" /><ui:ReadTextFile File="{x:Null}" Content="[analysisJson]" DisplayName="분석 결과(Step3 결과) 읽기" Encoding="utf-8" FileName="[System.IO.Path.Combine(testDir, &quot;step5&quot;, scName, &quot;analysis.json&quot;)]" /><ui:ReadTextFile File="{x:Null}" Content="[metaJson]" DisplayName="메타 정보 읽기" Encoding="utf-8" FileName="[System.IO.Path.Combine(testDir, &quot;step5&quot;, scName, &quot;meta.json&quot;)]" /><ui:InvokeCode DisplayName="메타 JSON 풀기 (Invoke Code, 테스트 전용)" Language="VBNet" Code="' (Step5 테스트 전용) 시나리오 메타 JSON 을 변수로 풀어 준다.&#xA;' In : metaJson(String) {&quot;fileName&quot;,&quot;seq&quot;,&quot;nowIso&quot;,&quot;promptVersion&quot;,&quot;sttEngine&quot;,&quot;genaiModel&quot;,&quot;sttError&quot;}&#xA;' Out: fileName, nowIso, promptVersion, sttEngine, genaiModel, sttStage, sttError (String), seq (Int32)&#xA;Dim rdMeta As New Newtonsoft.Json.JsonTextReader(New System.IO.StringReader(metaJson))&#xA;rdMeta.DateParseHandling = Newtonsoft.Json.DateParseHandling.None&#xA;Dim metaObj As Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JObject = Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JObject.Load(rdMeta)&#xA;fileName = metaObj.Value(Of String)(&quot;fileName&quot;)&#xA;seq = metaObj.Value(Of Integer)(&quot;seq&quot;)&#xA;nowIso = metaObj.Value(Of String)(&quot;nowIso&quot;)&#xA;promptVersion = metaObj.Value(Of String)(&quot;promptVersion&quot;)&#xA;sttEngine = metaObj.Value(Of String)(&quot;sttEngine&quot;)&#xA;genaiModel = metaObj.Value(Of String)(&quot;genaiModel&quot;)&#xA;sttStage = metaObj.Value(Of String)(&quot;sttStage&quot;)&#xA;sttError = metaObj.Value(Of String)(&quot;sttError&quot;)"><ui:InvokeCode.Arguments><scg:Dictionary x:TypeArguments="x:String, Argument"><InArgument x:TypeArguments="x:String" x:Key="metaJson">[metaJson]</InArgument><OutArgument x:TypeArguments="x:String" x:Key="fileName">[fileName]</OutArgument><OutArgument x:TypeArguments="x:Int32" x:Key="seq">[seq]</OutArgument><OutArgument x:TypeArguments="x:String" x:Key="nowIso">[nowIso]</OutArgument><OutArgument x:TypeArguments="x:String" x:Key="promptVersion">[promptVersion]</OutArgument><OutArgument x:TypeArguments="x:String" x:Key="sttEngine">[sttEngine]</OutArgument><OutArgument x:TypeArguments="x:String" x:Key="genaiModel">[genaiModel]</OutArgument><OutArgument x:TypeArguments="x:String" x:Key="sttStage">[sttStage]</OutArgument><OutArgument x:TypeArguments="x:String" x:Key="sttError">[sttError]</OutArgument></scg:Dictionary></ui:InvokeCode.Arguments></ui:InvokeCode><ui:InvokeCode DisplayName="최종 JSON 조립·상태 판정 (Invoke Code)" Language="VBNet" Code="' Step5: 최종 결과 JSON 조립 + 상태 판정  (Python: run_dummy.process 의 조립 부분, call_schema.json v1.0)&#xA;' In : maskedJson(String) Step4 결과 {&quot;transcript&quot;,&quot;pii&quot;}, analysisJson(String) Step3 결과 {&quot;result&quot;,&quot;error&quot;,&quot;retry_count&quot;},&#xA;'      sttStage(String) 앞 단계 실패 위치(&quot;INPUT&quot;/&quot;STT&quot;), sttError(String) 그 실패 사유(없으면 &quot;&quot;), fileName(String), seq(Int32) 순번, nowIso(String) &quot;yyyy-MM-ddTHH:mm:ss+09:00&quot;,&#xA;'      promptVersion, sttEngine, genaiModel(String)&#xA;' Out: docJson(String) 최종 JSON, assembleError(String; 성공이면 &quot;&quot;)&#xA;' 상태 판정: 유형 확신도 0.6 미만 또는 화자 구분 불확실(speaker_confidence=LOW)이면 NEEDS_REVIEW, 분석 실패/STT 실패면 FAILED, 그 외 SUCCESS&#xA;docJson = &quot;&quot;&#xA;assembleError = &quot;&quot;&#xA;Try&#xA;    Dim typeLabels As New System.Collections.Generic.Dictionary(Of String, String)&#xA;    typeLabels(&quot;INQUIRY&quot;) = &quot;질의&quot;&#xA;    typeLabels(&quot;COMPLAINT&quot;) = &quot;불만&quot;&#xA;    typeLabels(&quot;SUGGESTION&quot;) = &quot;건의&quot;&#xA;    typeLabels(&quot;TRAINING&quot;) = &quot;교육 내용&quot;&#xA;    typeLabels(&quot;OTHER&quot;) = &quot;기타 문의&quot;&#xA;&#xA;    Dim nowDt As System.DateTime = System.DateTime.ParseExact(nowIso.Substring(0, 19), &quot;yyyy-MM-dd'T'HH:mm:ss&quot;, System.Globalization.CultureInfo.InvariantCulture)&#xA;    Dim callId As String = nowDt.ToString(&quot;yyyyMMdd_HHmmss&quot;, System.Globalization.CultureInfo.InvariantCulture) &amp; &quot;_&quot; &amp; seq.ToString(&quot;000&quot;, System.Globalization.CultureInfo.InvariantCulture)&#xA;&#xA;    Dim nullTok As Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JToken = Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JValue.CreateNull()&#xA;    Dim doc As New Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JObject()&#xA;    Dim src As New Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JObject()&#xA;    src(&quot;file_name&quot;) = fileName&#xA;    src(&quot;file_path&quot;) = fileName&#xA;    src(&quot;duration_sec&quot;) = Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JValue.CreateNull()&#xA;    src(&quot;received_at&quot;) = nowIso&#xA;    Dim proc As New Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JObject()&#xA;    proc(&quot;stt_engine&quot;) = sttEngine&#xA;    proc(&quot;genai_model&quot;) = genaiModel&#xA;    proc(&quot;prompt_version&quot;) = promptVersion&#xA;    proc(&quot;retry_count&quot;) = 0&#xA;    proc(&quot;processed_at&quot;) = nowIso&#xA;&#xA;    doc(&quot;schema_version&quot;) = &quot;1.0&quot;&#xA;    doc(&quot;call_id&quot;) = callId&#xA;    doc(&quot;source&quot;) = src&#xA;    doc(&quot;call_datetime&quot;) = Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JValue.CreateNull()&#xA;    doc(&quot;agent_name&quot;) = Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JValue.CreateNull()&#xA;    doc(&quot;customer_company&quot;) = Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JValue.CreateNull()&#xA;&#xA;    ' 실패 건에 채우는 빈 분석 필드&#xA;    Dim fillEmpty As System.Action = Sub()&#xA;                                         doc(&quot;type&quot;) = Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JValue.CreateNull()&#xA;                                         doc(&quot;type_label&quot;) = Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JValue.CreateNull()&#xA;                                         doc(&quot;type_confidence&quot;) = Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JValue.CreateNull()&#xA;                                         doc(&quot;customer_question&quot;) = Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JValue.CreateNull()&#xA;                                         doc(&quot;agent_action&quot;) = Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JValue.CreateNull()&#xA;                                         doc(&quot;summary&quot;) = Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JValue.CreateNull()&#xA;                                         doc(&quot;follow_up_required&quot;) = Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JValue.CreateNull()&#xA;                                         doc(&quot;follow_up&quot;) = Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JValue.CreateNull()&#xA;                                         doc(&quot;keywords&quot;) = New Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JArray()&#xA;                                         doc(&quot;entities&quot;) = New Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JArray()&#xA;                                     End Sub&#xA;&#xA;    If sttError &lt;&gt; &quot;&quot; Then&#xA;        ' STT 단계 실패: 전사·마스킹 없이 실패 건으로&#xA;        Dim errObj As New Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JObject()&#xA;        errObj(&quot;stage&quot;) = If(sttStage = &quot;&quot;, &quot;STT&quot;, sttStage)&#xA;        errObj(&quot;reason&quot;) = sttError&#xA;        doc(&quot;status&quot;) = &quot;FAILED&quot;&#xA;        doc(&quot;error&quot;) = errObj&#xA;        fillEmpty()&#xA;        Dim emptyTr As New Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JObject()&#xA;        emptyTr(&quot;full_text&quot;) = Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JValue.CreateNull()&#xA;        emptyTr(&quot;segments&quot;) = New Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JArray()&#xA;        emptyTr(&quot;speaker_confidence&quot;) = Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JValue.CreateNull()&#xA;        Dim emptyPii As New Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JObject()&#xA;        emptyPii(&quot;masked&quot;) = False&#xA;        emptyPii(&quot;counts&quot;) = New Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JObject()&#xA;        doc(&quot;transcript&quot;) = emptyTr&#xA;        doc(&quot;pii&quot;) = emptyPii&#xA;    Else&#xA;        Dim rdM As New Newtonsoft.Json.JsonTextReader(New System.IO.StringReader(maskedJson))&#xA;        rdM.DateParseHandling = Newtonsoft.Json.DateParseHandling.None&#xA;        Dim maskedObj As Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JObject = Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JObject.Load(rdM)&#xA;        Dim rdA As New Newtonsoft.Json.JsonTextReader(New System.IO.StringReader(analysisJson))&#xA;        rdA.DateParseHandling = Newtonsoft.Json.DateParseHandling.None&#xA;        Dim analysisObj As Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JObject = Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JObject.Load(rdA)&#xA;&#xA;        Dim trTok As Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JObject = CType(maskedObj(&quot;transcript&quot;), Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JObject)&#xA;        Dim segArr As Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JArray = CType(trTok(&quot;segments&quot;), Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JArray)&#xA;        src(&quot;duration_sec&quot;) = segArr(segArr.Count - 1)(&quot;end_sec&quot;).DeepClone()&#xA;        proc(&quot;retry_count&quot;) = analysisObj(&quot;retry_count&quot;).DeepClone()&#xA;&#xA;        Dim speakerLow As Boolean = False&#xA;        Dim spTok As Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JToken = trTok(&quot;speaker_confidence&quot;)&#xA;        If spTok IsNot Nothing AndAlso spTok.Type = Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JTokenType.String Then speakerLow = (spTok.ToObject(Of String)() = &quot;LOW&quot;)&#xA;&#xA;        If analysisObj(&quot;error&quot;).Type &lt;&gt; Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JTokenType.Null Then&#xA;            ' 분석(검증·재시도) 실패&#xA;            doc(&quot;status&quot;) = &quot;FAILED&quot;&#xA;            doc(&quot;error&quot;) = analysisObj(&quot;error&quot;).DeepClone()&#xA;            fillEmpty()&#xA;        Else&#xA;            Dim res As Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JObject = CType(analysisObj(&quot;result&quot;), Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JObject)&#xA;            Dim lowConf As Boolean = (res(&quot;type_confidence&quot;).ToObject(Of Double)() &lt; 0.6)&#xA;            doc(&quot;status&quot;) = If(lowConf OrElse speakerLow, &quot;NEEDS_REVIEW&quot;, &quot;SUCCESS&quot;)&#xA;            doc(&quot;error&quot;) = Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JValue.CreateNull()&#xA;            For Each prop As Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JProperty In res.Properties()&#xA;                doc(prop.Name) = prop.Value.DeepClone()&#xA;            Next&#xA;            doc(&quot;type_label&quot;) = typeLabels(res(&quot;type&quot;).ToObject(Of String)())&#xA;        End If&#xA;        doc(&quot;transcript&quot;) = trTok.DeepClone()&#xA;        doc(&quot;pii&quot;) = maskedObj(&quot;pii&quot;).DeepClone()&#xA;    End If&#xA;    doc(&quot;processing&quot;) = proc&#xA;    docJson = doc.ToString(Newtonsoft.Json.Formatting.None)&#xA;Catch ex As System.Exception&#xA;    assembleError = &quot;결과 조립 실패(&quot; &amp; ex.GetType().Name &amp; &quot;): &quot; &amp; ex.Message&#xA;    docJson = &quot;&quot;&#xA;End Try"><ui:InvokeCode.Arguments><scg:Dictionary x:TypeArguments="x:String, Argument"><InArgument x:TypeArguments="x:String" x:Key="maskedJson">[maskedJson]</InArgument><InArgument x:TypeArguments="x:String" x:Key="analysisJson">[analysisJson]</InArgument><InArgument x:TypeArguments="x:String" x:Key="sttStage">[sttStage]</InArgument><InArgument x:TypeArguments="x:String" x:Key="sttError">[sttError]</InArgument><InArgument x:TypeArguments="x:String" x:Key="fileName">[fileName]</InArgument><InArgument x:TypeArguments="x:Int32" x:Key="seq">[seq]</InArgument><InArgument x:TypeArguments="x:String" x:Key="nowIso">[nowIso]</InArgument><InArgument x:TypeArguments="x:String" x:Key="promptVersion">[promptVersion]</InArgument><InArgument x:TypeArguments="x:String" x:Key="sttEngine">[sttEngine]</InArgument><InArgument x:TypeArguments="x:String" x:Key="genaiModel">[genaiModel]</InArgument><OutArgument x:TypeArguments="x:String" x:Key="docJson">[docJson]</OutArgument><OutArgument x:TypeArguments="x:String" x:Key="assembleError">[assembleError]</OutArgument></scg:Dictionary></ui:InvokeCode.Arguments></ui:InvokeCode><If Condition="[assembleError &lt;&gt; &quot;&quot;]" DisplayName="조립 오류?"><If.Then><Throw DisplayName="조립 실패" Exception="[New System.InvalidOperationException(assembleError &amp; &quot; (시나리오: &quot; &amp; scName &amp; &quot;)&quot;)]" /></If.Then></If><ui:CreateDirectory DisplayName="결과 폴더 만들기" Output="{x:Null}" Path="[System.IO.Path.Combine(outDir, &quot;step5&quot;)]" /><ui:WriteTextFile File="{x:Null}" Output="{x:Null}" DisplayName="최종 JSON 저장" Encoding="utf-8" FileName="[System.IO.Path.Combine(outDir, &quot;step5&quot;, scName &amp; &quot;.json&quot;)]" Text="[docJson]" /><ui:LogMessage DisplayName="로그" Level="Info" Message="[scName &amp; &quot; 조립 완료 (&quot; &amp; docJson.Length.ToString() &amp; &quot;자)&quot;]" /></Sequence></ActivityAction></ui:ForEach.Body></ui:ForEach></Sequence>
